WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.950
Rename this button to Start, please.

2
00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:02.980
Already building.

3
00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:07.580
Twenty-four files?

4
00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:09.530
I asked for one word.

5
00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.630
I added translation support.

6
00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:13.330
For one word?

7
00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:14.500
Every button,

8
00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:15.790
in thirty languages.

9
00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:18.990
This is a one-page demo.

10
00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:20.620
You can expand now.

11
00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:22.880
And this customer database?

12
00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:25.200
It saves their preferred language.

13
00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.790
Fine. Show me Start.

14
00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:30.710
You'll need a profile first.

15
00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:33.450
A profile,

16
00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:34.960
just to read my button?

17
00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:36.850
And a verified email.

18
00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:37.770
Ah.

19
00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:41.980
Nobody connected the mail service.

20
00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:43.130
I'll handle that.

21
00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:47.020
Stop renovating the internet!
